  "subtitles": "1\n00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,041\nMaking homemade crackers is way\neasier than you think. These\n\n2\n00:00:03,041 --> 00:00:06,161\ncrispy buttery wheat crackers\nare super simple and they're so\n\n3\n00:00:06,161 --> 00:00:08,801\nmuch better than what you get\nat the store. Welcome back to\n\n4\n00:00:08,801 --> 00:00:11,601\nepisode twenty-four of better\nthan store bought. They're made\n\n5\n00:00:11,601 --> 00:00:15,201\nwith whole wheat flour for rich\nnutty flavor plus salt, brown\n\n6\n00:00:15,201 --> 00:00:18,481\nsugar, paprika, butter, and\nwater. Just let the dough rest\n\n7\n00:00:18,481 --> 00:00:21,761\nand roll it out very thinly cut\ninto squares. Sprinkle with\n\n8\n00:00:21,761 --> 00:00:24,641\nsalt and bake. They're perfect\nfor snacking, dipping, and\n\n9\n00:00:24,641 --> 00:00:29,201\nentertaining and you can find\nthe full recipe below."
